  "body": "Brand-new, single-level living in Orewa\r\n\r\nFeatures you’ll love:\r\n\r\n- Rare four-bedroom home within the development\r\n- Master suite with ensuite & deck access\r\n- Designer kitchen with stone benchtops, breakfast bar & skylight\r\n- Underfloor heating in bathrooms\r\n- Internal access garage with dedicated laundry & storage\r\n- Surround sound system\r\n- Off-street parking & easy-care grounds\r\n\r\nThe light-filled open-plan living and dining area connects seamlessly to an elevated deck, creating a fantastic space for entertaining while enjoying beautiful sunsets. Steps lead down to the lawn, extending the living outdoors.\r\n\r\nFour generous bedrooms and two contemporary bathrooms provide plenty of space, with the private master suite enjoying its own ensuite and direct access outdoors.\r\n\r\nJust minutes from Orewa Beach, Silverdale Shopping Centre, cafés, schools and motorway access, this home delivers coastal living with everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nCall us today to arrange your private viewing, or we look forward to meeting you at the open home. Conjunctions from all agent's welcome.\r\n\r\n(Please note: Some images have been virtually staged for illustrative purposes)",
